## 3. How It Works (Data Flow)

```
[Simulation Engine / P1]
         │
         │ Passes Coarse GlobalStateSnapshot:
         │ - timestamp (e.g., 5.0s)
         │ - corridor_occupancy (e.g., {0: 5, 1: 2, 2: 7})
         │ - agent_ids (e.g., [101, 102, 103, 104])
         ▼
[P4: GlobalOverseer.update()]
         │
         │ 1. Validate snapshot safety
         │ 2. Find least-loaded corridor:
         │      Agent 101 -> Corridor 1 (occupancy 2 -> 3)
         │      Agent 102 -> Corridor 1 (occupancy 3 -> 4)
         │      Agent 103 -> Corridor 1 (occupancy 4 -> 5)
         │      Agent 104 -> Tie between Corridor 0 & 1 -> Corridor 0
         │ 3. Package OverseerDirective
         ▼
[OverseerDirective Emitted to P1 & P3]
         - corridor_map: {101: 1, 102: 1, 103: 1, 104: 0}
         - priority_table: {EMERGENCY: 0, EVTOL: 1, DELIVERY: 2}
         - altitude_map: {101: 0, 102: 0, 103: 0, 104: 0}
         - timestamp: 5.0
```

